v class=\"title\">Fraud risk assessment</div>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">Why does financial crime occur?</div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    At scale, financial crime WILL occur with statistical regularity if the right combination of elements are present.\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Triangle diagram -->\n  <figure class=\"placeholder triangle\">\n    <div class=\"tri-part tri-left\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tri-part tri-right\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tri-part tri-bottom\"></div>\n    <div class=\"lbl lbl-incentives\">Incentives</div>\n    <div class=\"lbl lbl-rationalisation\">Rationalisation</div>\n    <div class=\"lbl lbl-opportunity\">Opportunity</div>\n  </figure>\n\n  <!-- Left green box -->\n  <div class=\"box box-green\">\n    <h3>TRANSACTIONAL</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Expectations to meet (financial) targets</li>\n      <li>Hide failing projects or contracts</li>\n      <li>Need for new financing</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3 class=\"sub\">PERSONAL</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Financial problems</li>\n      <li>Extravagant life style</li>\n      <li>Addictions (drug or gambling habits)</li>\n      <li>Greed or revenge</li>\n      <li>Character flaws (i.e. sociopathic disorder)</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right blue box -->\n  <div class=\"box box-blue-right\">\n    <h3>FRACTURED LOGIC...</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>&ldquo;My performance isn&rsquo;t recognized&rdquo;</li>\n      <li>&ldquo;Management doesn&rsquo;t care&rdquo;</li>\n      <li>&ldquo;Everyone else is does it&rdquo;</li>\n      <li>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m only borrowing&rdquo;</li>\n      <li>&ldquo;It&rsquo;s the cost of doing business&rdquo;</li>\n      <li>&ldquo;I have been mistreated and deserve compensation&rdquo;</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bottom navy box -->\n  <div class=\"box box-navy-bottom\">\n    <h3>SYSTEMIC WEAKNESSES</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Lack of oversight</li>\n      <li>Conflict</li>\n      <li>Implementation of new accounting software</li>\n      <li>High volume transactions (easy hiding)</li>\n      <li>New &amp; complex products</li>\n      <li>Grey areas in the rules</li>\n      <li>Ineffective internal controls</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-num\">15</div>\n  <div class=\"copyright\">&copy; 2014 Deloitte The Netherlands</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
